        "original_id": "c8e29435-4dae-5acf-9570-2027b5045f1f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: \"Simpsons Already Did It\", \"Professor Chaos\", \"Jared Has Aides\", \"The Simpsons\", South Park season 6\n- Series: \"South Park\"\n- People: Trey Parker, Matt Stone\n- Topics: episode order, season continuity, broadcast timing\n\nFacts:\n- South Park season 6 of the American animated television series \"South Park\", created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, began airing on March 6, 2002.\n- \"Jared Has Aides\" is the first episode of the sixth season of the adult American animated television series \"South Park\".\n- \"Simpsons Already Did It\" is the seventh episode of the sixth season of the American animated television series \"South Park\" and the 86th episode of the series overall.\n- \"Simpsons Already Did It\" continues from the events of the previous \"South Park\" episode \"Professor Chaos\".\n- In \"Simpsons Already Did It\", Butters devises schemes to take over the world and discovers that each scheme was already done on \"The Simpsons\".",
